      "question": "If a dice has numbers 1 to 6 on its faces and face 1 is opposite to 6, 3 is opposite to 4, then what will be the number on the opposite to the face showing '2'?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If a dice has numbers 1 to 6 on its faces and face 1 is opposite to 6, 3 is opposite to 4, then what will be the number on the opposite to the face showing '2'? </p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "3",
          "html": "<p>3 </p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "<p>6 </p>"
        },
        {
