          "text": "4",
          "html": "<p>4 </p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "<p>5 </p>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "4",
      "solution": "<p>A standard dice has 6 faces numbered 1 to 6, and each number has exactly one opposite face. <br/>• It is given that 1 is opposite to 6 and 3 is opposite to 4 . <br/>• After fixing these pairs, the remaining numbers are 2 and 5 . <br/>• Therefore, the only possibility is that 2 is opposite to 5 . </p>",
